# tools_tests.known-failures -- failures the `tools_tests` row (scripts/run_tools_tests.py)
# is allowed to see. Format: FAIL <nodeid-or-module> :: <first line of the failure>
# The row FAILS if a listed entry starts passing (stale: delete the line) or if
# anything NOT listed fails. Nobody fixed these when the row was added (2026-10-09);
# they are pre-existing and pinned so the rest of the tier can regress loudly.
